    "sections": {
        "description": "The AI Enterprise theme is a responsive template designed for technology, automation, and data-driven websites. It includes a dark interface with gradient accents, a flexible header, and multiple pre-built section layouts such as hero banners, feature grids, pricing tables, team sliders, testimonials, FAQ accordions, and blog archives. The theme supports drag-and-drop page building, customizable color schemes, typography options, and a configurable mega menu. It is compatible with popular page builders, contact form plugins, newsletter tools, and SEO plugins. Code is structured for fast loading, schema markup, and Core Web Vitals alignment. Additional features include RTL support, translation-ready files, custom widgets, reusable templates, and demo content for quick setup. Regular updates and documentation are provided with the package."
    },
